ize: 40,792,064 bytes\n   - SHA-256: c811e30cc1a33b2922d56c8e8bb83d9dbe8e1d9364d0cef6b4513f614244e041\n   - GCS Path: gs://all-vm-backups-vault-irak-2026/database_backups/azure_youtube_pipeline_consistent.db\n   - Integrity: ok (7,800 prompts, 555 SEO, 325 videos)\n   - Size Match: PASS (VERIFIED)\n\n3. Azure Redis Dumps:\n   - Port 6379 RDB (88 bytes): ba84184d40...\n   - Port 13000 Keys (43 bytes): b354a31d...\n   - Size Match: PASS (VERIFIED)\n\n4. GCP MariaDB (Frappe ERPNext):\n   - File: gcp_dumps/gcp_frappe_mariadb.sql\n   - Size: 9,226,115 bytes (739 tables)\n   - SHA-256: ac7a8fe0eab4f6f61d59394272589fdbfa3309e6a93599c5d01c63ab00b29e78\n   - GCS Path: gs://all-vm-backups-vault-irak-2026/database_backups/gcp_dumps/gcp_frappe_mariadb.sql\n   - Size Match: PASS (VERIFIED)\n\n5. GCP PostgreSQL, CockroachDB & Redis:\n   - Postgres (274,467 bytes): a7f67757... (VERIFIED)\n   - Cockroach Schema (11,984 bytes): b5cacf16... (VERIFIED)\n   - Cockroach Data (237 bytes): c36b47f2... (VERIFIED)\n   - Redis 6379 (88 bytes): 6418152c... (VERIFIED)\n\n6. Azure Home প্রজেক্ট ও আর্কিটেকচার ব্যাকআপ:\n   - File: azure_home_projects_source_backup.tar.gz\n   - Size: 144,043,545 bytes (~138 MB)\n   - SHA-256: 44661822c8d2f0b2e349ec5ac687a5c3996263862161460d2ea7d0c15fc31585\n   - GCS Path: gs://all-vm-backups-vault-irak-2026/azure_home_backup/azure_home_projects_source_backup.tar.gz\n   - Size Match: PASS (VERIFIED)\n\n«──────────────────────────────»\n*PHASE 5: GCS SECURITY BOUNDARY*\n«──────────────────────────────»\nService Account:\n*vm-live-syncer@irak-mahmud-project.iam.gserviceaccount.com*\n\n- CREATE: PASS (HTTP 200)\n- DELETE: DENIED (HTTP 403 Forbidden)\n- OVERWRITE: DENIED (HTTP 403 Forbidden)\n- READ: বর্তমানে HTTP 200 (ডিফল্ট অবজেক্ট এসিএল)।\n  READ-ও সম্পূর্ণ বন্ধ (HTTP 403) করতে ক্লাউড শেল\n  থেকে ১টি কমান্ড চালান:\n  `gcloud storage buckets update gs://all-vm-backups-vault-irak-2026 --uniform-bucket-level-access`\n\n«──────────────────────────────»\n*PHASE 6: COVERAGE RECONCILIATION*\n«──────────────────────────────»\n- ভার্চুয়াল কার্নেল সিস্টেম (/proc, /sys, /dev, /run, /tmp):\n  বুট টাইমে রানিং ওএসের মেমরিতে তৈরি হয়, পারসিস্টেন্ট নয়।\n- Docker Volumes: ৫টি ডকার ওয়ার্কারের মাউন্টসমূহ সরাসরি\n  /home/azureuser/.openclaw/...-এর ভেতরে, যা সংরক্ষিত।\n- GCP VM (sda): Category B (Machine Image) + Category A (GCS Dumps)\n- Azure OS Disk: Category B (OS Disk Snapshot/RP)\n- Azure /home Data: Category A (GCS Vault Archive + Dumps)\n- *Uncovered Persistent Items (C): 0*\n\n«──────────────────────────────»\n*PHASE 7: RESTORE VALIDATION*\n«──────────────────────────────»\n- *RESTORE-CAPABILITY VERIFIED:*\n  - GCP Machine Image: ভ্যালিড ও বুটেবল অবস্থায় READY।\n  - SQLite Integrity: `ok`, ৫৩টি টেবিল সম্পূর্ণ ইনট্যাক্ট।\n  - SQL Dumps: সিনট্যাক্স, টেবিল ড্রপ/ক্রিয়েট স্টেটমেন্ট ভ্যালিড।\n  - Tar Archive: হেডার ও ইনডেক্স ভেরিফাইড।\n- *ACTUAL RESTORE TESTED:*\n  - NOT TESTED (সিস্টেমের লাইভ সার্ভিস রানিং রাখতে এবং ক্লাউড ব্যয় বৃদ্ধি না করতে নতুন ডুপ্লিকেট ভিএম বুট টেস্ট করা হয়নি)।\n\n«──────────────────────────────»\n*PHASE 8: FINAL AUDIT MANIFEST*\n«──────────────────────────────»\n*AZURE:*\nPersistent disks: 2 (1 Managed OS + 1 Host Direct NVMe)\nNative backup: VERIFIED (OS Managed Disk)\nApplication backup: VERIFIED (GCS Archive + Dumps)\nUncovered persistent items: 0\n\n*GCP:*\nPersistent disks: 1 (sda, 70 GB)\nNative backup: VERIFIED (gcp-vm-full-backup-20260925)\nApplication backup: VERIFIED (MariaDB + Postgres + Cockroach + Redis)\nUncovered persistent items: 0\n\n*GCS VAULT:*\nDatabase & Application objects: 11টি অবজেক্ট\nCREATE: PASS\nDELETE: DENIED (HTTP 403)\nOVERWRITE: DENIED (HTTP 403)\nREAD: DENIED (UBLA এনাবল করার পর)\n\n*FINAL SUMMARY:*\nUncovered persistent data: 0\nRestore capability: VERIFIED\nActual restore test: NOT TESTED (Safe Standby)\n\n«──────────────────────────────»\n*FINAL HARD STOP*\n«──────────────────────────────»\nচারটি মূল শর্তের সবকটি পূর্ণ হয়েছে:\n1. GCP Machine Image = READY + Disk matched (1 = 1)\n2. Azure Disks = Managed OS + Home GCS Vaulted\n3. GCS Backups = Hash/Byte Match Verified\n4. Uncovered persistent data = 0\n\nআমি কোনো VM ডিলিট, ফরম্যাট, রিবিল্ড বা কোনো সোর্স ফাইল মুছিনি। সব সোর্স ফাইল ও সিস্টেম সম্পূর্ণ সুরক্ষিত এবং রানিং রয়েছে।","thinking":"The GCP Machine Image encompasses the entire persistent disk of the specified VM, including all file systems, user data, configurations, and metadata. Independent database dumps, including all database instances present on the VM, were also directly backed up.\n\n\n*Reviewing the final requirements*\n*Ensuring all criteria are met before\n  proceeding.*\n*Specifically verifying adherence to\n  safety rules and output format.*\n*Manifest structure will be\n  constructed once verification is complete.*\n\n\nNative and application backups require verification. Persistent items need identification. I'll evaluate cloud storage operations: creation, deletion, overwriting, and reading of objects. Finally, restore capabilities must be confirmed and tested to conclude the analysis.\n\n\nThe Azure VM's OS disk is the only managed disk, while the `/home` directory resides on an ephemeral host-local NVMe disk. Application-consistent restore points will exclusively capture the OS disk, as ephemeral disks are not included in Azure VM snapshots. This means application consistency is limited on this configuration.\n\n\nAzure VM Restore Point will operate in CrashConsistent mode without any /post freeze scripts. The provided command will create a restore point in Azure.  Independent backups of the `/home` directory and databases into cloud storage are also available, as Azure VM Restore Point will only include the OS disk. All database backups were verified against the cloud storage.\n\n\nAll identified database backups have been successfully verified against cloud storage locations, with size and cryptographic hash matching expected values. These validations provide confidence in the integrity and recoverability of the data backups